\fs28 \cf10 \cb18 String
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb18 StaticString
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  can be implicitly created from a 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb18 StringLiteral
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 , but without a type annotation, Mojo defaults to materializing 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb18 StringLiteral
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  as a 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb18 String
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 .\
